      <p source="#source-227-256"><seg source="#source-227-256">風と新聞紙はほいと</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-256-291"><seg source="#source-256-291">柳の若い葉の下をぬけて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-291-318"><seg source="#source-291-318">お堀にすべりこんだ</seg></p>
